1. What Storage Does It Protect?
Defender for Storage supports major Azure storage services.
Storage Type	Activity Monitoring	Malware Scanning	Sensitive Data Discovery
Azure Blob Storage	✅	✅	✅
Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2	✅	✅	✅
Azure Files	✅	❌	❌
Memory: Defender for Storage covers Blob, Data Lake Gen2, and Azure Files, but advanced file-scanning capabilities vary by storage type.
 
