2. Main Security Capabilities
Defender for Storage has three important areas to remember:
1. Activity Monitoring
2. Malware Scanning
3. Sensitive Data Threat Detection
 
⸻
 
3. Activity Monitoring
Defender for Storage analyzes activity associated with storage accounts to identify suspicious behavior.
Data Plane Activity
Data-plane operations interact with the actual data.
Examples:
* Upload files
* Download files
* Read data
* Access blobs/files
Control Plane Activity
Control-plane operations manage the storage resource itself.
Examples:
* Create storage accounts
* Change configuration
* Modify settings
* Delete resources
Storage Activity
       │
       ├── Data Plane
       │     ├── Upload
       │     ├── Download
       │     └── Read
       │
       └── Control Plane
             ├── Create
             ├── Configure
             └── Delete
 
