12. How Can You Enable Defender for Storage?
There are two common management scopes.
Subscription Level
Enable protection at the subscription level:
Subscription
│
├── Storage Account 1
├── Storage Account 2
├── Storage Account 3
└── Future Storage Accounts
This is useful when an organization wants broad protection across its storage environment.
 
⸻
 
Storage Account Level
Enable protection for individual storage accounts.
Useful when:
* Testing the feature
* Protecting only critical accounts
* Controlling costs
* Applying protection selectively
Subscription
│
├── Storage A → Protected
├── Storage B → Protected
└── Storage C → Not enabled
 
